{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06262","headline":"送晁补阙归日本国 · 赵骅","name":"送晁补阙归日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西掖承休澣，东隅返故林。\n来称郯子学，归是越人吟。\n马上秋郊远，舟中曙海阴。\n知君怀魏阙，万里独摇心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵骅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}